or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, June to July is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Barnstable County, with 5.67 inches normal, and it came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, June to July ran 60% of normal and August to September ran 52%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 47% and April to May at 66%. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, as low as 53% on grid 26338.</p>"}
